  "notes": "Label is the GPIO PIN number box (light grey, printed as e.g. 26 or 04 with leading zero, copied as printed); silkscreen name at the JST pin first in functions, then CHIP PIN number and CircuitPython names read outward. Callout rows mapped to JST pins in the same top-to-bottom order. 'SWD 25' and 'SWCLK 24' (CORTEX DBG) callout lines run behind the board and cannot be traced to the D/C pads, so they are not attached. Buttons, status LEDs and the D13 LED are skipped."
